WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.580
What is 3 × (x + 2)?

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:08.260
Picture a rectangle 3 tall and x + 2 wide.

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:10.150
Split it in two.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.950
One part is 3x.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.640
The other is 6.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:17.080
So the answer is 3x + 6.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:21.013
Check with x as 1: both give 9.
